              Without a comprehensive, dedicated health shield, an investor with an accumulated ₹40 Lakh portfolio is forced to liquidate almost their entire investment overnight to save a family member. If this medical event coincides with a market recession, you sell depressed units at a steep loss, resetting your compounding engine back to year zero.
